      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oké"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only give attention when all four paws are on the ground. Reward sitting automatically." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Geef alleen aandacht als alle vier de poten op de grond staan. Beloon automatisch zitten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overtired puppies are more reactive and bark more. More naps often means less barking." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vermoeide puppy's zijn reactiever en blaffen meer. Meer dutjes betekent vaak minder blaffen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overtired puppies are more reactive. More sleep often means less barking." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vermoeide puppy's zijn reactiever. Meer slaap betekent vaak minder blaffen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overtired puppies bite more. Getting enough sleep will reduce nipping." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vermoeide puppy's bijten meer. Genoeg slaap vermindert het bijten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Potty training" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zindelijkheidstraining"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puppies chew when bored or understimulated. Provide appropriate chew toys and puzzles." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puppy's kauwen als ze zich vervelen. Zorg voor geschikt kauwspeelgoed en puzzels."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puppies don't know when they're tired. After 1-2 hours awake, put them in the crate for a nap." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puppy's weten niet wanneer ze moe zijn. Na 1-2 uur wakker zijn, doe ze in de bench voor een dutje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puppies naturally avoid soiling where they sleep. The crate makes potty training much easier." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puppy's vermijden van nature hun slaapplaats te bevuilen. De bench maakt zindelijkheidstraining veel makkelijker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puppies need 18-20 hours of sleep per day. If yours isn't sleeping this much, enforce more naps." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puppy's hebben 18-20 uur slaap per dag nodig. Als die van jou niet zoveel slaapt, dwing meer dutjes af."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puppies will settle if you can wait through about 1 minute of whining. Sit nearby so they know you're there." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puppy's kalmeren als je ongeveer 1 minuut janken kunt afwachten. Zit dichtbij zodat ze weten dat je er bent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Put the crate in a quiet corner of a social room - not isolated, but not in the middle of activity." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zet de bench in een rustig hoekje van een sociale ruimte - niet geïsoleerd, maar ook niet midden in de drukte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick check-in" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Snelle check-in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redirect to toys" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leid af naar speelgoed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Regular crate time teaches your pup that being alone is okay. Start with short periods." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Regelmatige benchtijd leert je pup dat alleen zijn oké is. Begin met korte periodes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resource guarding" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bezitsdrang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set as main focus" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stel in als hoofdfocus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skills training" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vaardigheidstraining"
