    "Struggling" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Moeilijk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Submit" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verstuur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take your puppy out immediately after waking, eating, playing, and every 1-2 hours while awake." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Neem je pup direct naar buiten na het wakker worden, eten, spelen, en elke 1-2 uur als die wakker is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teething relief" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verlichting bij tanden wisselen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank your pup for alerting you, then redirect with a 'quiet' cue or toy." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bedank je pup voor het waarschuwen, leid dan om met een 'stil' commando of speelgoed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 1-minute rule" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De 1-minuut regel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The crate gives you a timeout option and ensures your pup gets enough rest." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De bench geeft je een time-out optie en zorgt dat je pup genoeg rust krijgt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The crate should always be positive. Never use it as punishment or your pup will resist going in." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De bench moet altijd positief zijn. Gebruik het nooit als straf, anders gaat je pup tegenstribbelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timing is everything" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Timing is alles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tired or bored puppies chew more. Enforcing naps helps." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vermoeide of verveelde puppy's kauwen meer. Dutjes afdwingen helpt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Train before meals" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Train voor maaltijden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn away" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Draai je om"
