    "Walks" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wandelingen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch for overtired signs" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Let op signalen van oververmoeidheid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We don't have data on this yet." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We hebben hier nog geen data over."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do you most want help with?" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Waar wil je het meeste hulp bij?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When biting gets intense, calmly put your pup in the crate for a few minutes to settle down." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als het bijten intens wordt, doe je pup rustig in de bench voor een paar minuten om te kalmeren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the leash goes tight, stop moving. Only walk again when there's slack. Consistency is key." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als de riem strak komt, stop met bewegen. Loop pas weer als er slack is. Consistentie is de sleutel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you can't supervise, the crate prevents destructive chewing." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je niet kunt toezien, voorkomt de bench destructief kauwen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When your pup jumps, turn away and ignore. Attention - even negative - rewards jumping." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je pup springt, draai je om en negeer. Aandacht - zelfs negatief - beloont springen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why crate training matters" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Waarom benchtraining belangrijk is"
          }
        }
      }
